%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontFamily": "Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif", "fontSize": "14px"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant R as Researcher
    participant I as Implementer
    participant V as Reviewer

    User->>O: Task
    O->>O: Plan and choose handlers
    O->>R: Delegate research
    Note over R: uses web-research skill
    R-->>O: Sourced brief
    O->>I: Delegate implementation
    Note over I: preloads code-reviewer skill
    I-->>O: Change + self-review
    O->>V: Request review
    V-->>O: Critical / Warning / Suggestion
    O-->>User: Consolidated result
